{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12407","headline":"题郎士元半日吴村别业兼呈李长官 · 钱起","name":"题郎士元半日吴村别业兼呈李长官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半日吴村带晚霞，闲门高柳乱飞鵶。\n横云岭外千重树，流水声中一两家。\n愁人昨夜相思苦，闰月今年春意赊。\n自叹梅生头似雪，却怜潘令县如花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}